<title>UK: UK's Calor agrees terms for Dutch SHV deal.</title>
<headline>UK's Calor agrees terms for Dutch SHV deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calor Group Plc said it has agreed terms with Dutch firm SHV Energy Holdings UK Ltd for Calor to become a wholly-owned unit of SHV.</p>
<p>Under the deal SHV will pay 300 pence in cash, valuing the issued share capital of Calor at about 506 million stg.</p>
<p>On Monday Calor announced that the private Dutch conglomerate, which owns 51.9 percent of Calor, was to buy the remainder of the group.</p>
</text>
